                     https://fonts.google.com/specimen/JetBrains+Mono

The copyright lines are those of each family's OFL.txt in github.com/google/fonts (ofl/<family>/).
Each family is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, copied in full at the end of
this file (also at https://openfontlicense.org/). None of the five declares a Reserved Font Name.

The files are the standard Google Fonts subsets (latin / latin-ext, and vietnamese where the family
has it), unchanged. Google Sans Flex (opsz 6–144, wght 1–1000), Google Sans Code (wght 300–800, at
its default MONO 1: monospaced) and JetBrains Mono (wght 100–800) are variable fonts, one file per
subset. Regenerate or add families with vendor.py. Font/brand names are trademarks of their owners
— used here only to name the typeface, not to imply endorsement.

Families a site names in router.fonts that are not vendored here are downloaded from Google Fonts at
run time into the server's own cache (download.go) — open-source families only, under their own
licenses, served unchanged.


